      "number": "270",
      "text": "270. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u7b49\u6bd4\u6570\u5217$(b_n)$\u7684\u524d5\u9879\uff0c\u8bbe\uff1a\na) $b_1=6$\uff0c$q=2$\uff1b\nb) $b_1=-16$\uff0c$q=\\frac{1}{2}$\uff1b\nc) $b_1=\\frac{3}{4}$\uff0c$q=-\\frac{2}{3}$\uff1b\nd) $b_1=-24$\uff0c$q=-1.5$\uff1b\ne) $b_1=0.4$\uff0c$q=\\sqrt{2}$\uff1b\nf) $b_1=1.8$\uff0c$q=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}$.",
