    {
      "number": "277",
      "text": "277. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u5f0f\u7684\u5b9a\u4e49\u57df\uff1a\na) $\\sqrt{2x-3}+\\sqrt{3-2x}$\uff1b\nb) $\\sqrt{6x}-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5x+1}}$\uff1b\nc) $\\frac{1}{x^2-3x}+\\sqrt{7-4x}$\uff1b\nd) $\\frac{4}{x^2-16}-\\sqrt{10-2x}$.",
